# 14. DOCUMENT VISIBILITY

Document visibility is relationship-based.

Relevant relationships may include:

- creator
- current holder
- current workflow-step assignee
- past workflow-step assignee
- signature-field assignee
- history actor
- eligible department reviewer

A user-specific `view` denial may override access.

Do NOT assume a role-level wildcard `view` permission means organisation-wide document visibility.

Backend visibility remains authoritative.

