# 26. ATTACHMENTS

Native DocuTracker currently uses a single active attachment reference per document through:

- `file_path`
- `file_name`

Do not assume arbitrary multi-file support.

Current attachment constraints include:

- PDF
- JPG
- JPEG
- PNG
- maximum 10 MB

Do not widen supported types or size limits only on the frontend.

Any constraint change must be consistent with backend upload validation.

Never expose physical server file paths.

Attachment access must respect backend permission checks.

