# 27. SIGNATURES

DocuTracker includes multiple signature systems:

- native document builder signatures
- DTR leave signatures
- RSP signatures
- L&D signatures
- signature assets/library

Do not assume these systems are interchangeable.

Before changing signature behavior inspect the relevant service.

Signer authorization must be decided server-side.

